~ pigeon_wins

Pigeon: Ha! Victory is mine!
Penguin: Impossible... how did you beat me?

do GameManager.sidequest_skipped.emit()
do GameManager.sidequest_skipped.emit()

Pigeon: So... what should I do with my glorious win?

- Celebrate like a champion => res1
- Be nice and spare the penguin => res2

~ res1
Pigeon: This rooftop is officially MY kingdom now.
Pigeon: You promised to answer. Keep your promise.
=> win_questions


~ res2
Pigeon: You fought well. We can share the roof.
Pigeon: You promised to answer. Keep your promise.
=> win_questions


~ win_questions
- Why in the middle of summer it is snowy? => snow_qa
- What do you know about my friends' locations? => friends_qa
- How did you end up here? => peng_qa
- I have no more questions left => bye

~ snow_qa
Penguin: You truly think this is weather?
Penguin: No. We brought it here.
Penguin: Ships. Ice cores. Atmospheric triggers.
Penguin: We turned summer into winter.

- Why?
Penguin: Snow slows wings.
Penguin: Snow divides flocks.
Penguin: Snow makes control… easier. => win_questions


~ friends_qa
Penguin: Your flock is secured.

Pigeon: Secured where?

Penguin: Northern ridge. Beyond the frozen river.
Penguin: Old observatory grounds.

Pigeon: That’s outside migration territory.

Penguin: Exactly.
Penguin: Hard to leave.
Penguin: Harder to be found. => win_questions


~ peng_qa
Penguin: I did not end up here.
Penguin: I built this.

Pigeon: Built what?

Penguin: The storm.
Penguin: The relocation.
Penguin: The new order.

Penguin: Penguins do not wait for seasons anymore. => win_questions

~ bye
Penguin: Ok. I've ever met you, you've never met me.
Penguin: Otherwise don't hope that I'll spare your life.
- Agreed.
Penguin: Go away then.
Pigeon: Goodbye.

do GameManager.quest_ui_enable.emit(true)
do GameManager.chapter_1_finished.emit()
=> END


~ draw
Penguin: You look like you have some wings to flap. 
Penguin: You were lucky that the match ended in draw. I'll crush you in the next round.
Penguin: If you are brave enough to handle one more round with me.

- Accept defeat => penguin_wins
- Continue battling => restart

~ restart
do GameManager.minigame_restart_requested.emit()

=> END

~ last_chance
Penguin:  You. I don't like you. But I can give you one last chance.
Penguin: My bro is very sick. So take your feathered butt and get some super rare, not scatetered acrosss all map branches.
Penguin: You have 20 mins to do it. I won't repeat. Now shush and get to work.

do GameManager.lost_minigame.emit()
=> END